:TOOLTIP Autoattacks generate 5 Bloodwell (tripled while Crimson Blossom is active). On death, creates an unbreakable Blood Blossom statue at the spot, lasting 3 turns, healing allies within 2 tiles each turn by whatever Bloodwell Trappus had when he died.
